{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-friendly-pipeline-design","title":"AI 友好的流水线设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/foundations/ai-friendly-pipeline-design","wordCount":1165,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-友好的流水线设计\">AI 友好的流水线设计</h1><p>一条流水线对 AI Agent 是否&quot;友好&quot;，取决于它产出的信号能否被 agent 有效消费。传统流水线的设计目标是让人类工程师能读懂输出——颜色高亮、人类可读的错误摘要、HTML 报告。AI Agent 对这些格式的消化能力远不如对结构化数据。</p>\n<p>本文系统阐述如何改造流水线的输出层，使其同时满足人类可读性和 agent 可消费性，并给出日志结构化、错误信息语义化、上下文注入的具体实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>AI 友好性</strong>（AI-Friendliness）指流水线产出的日志、错误信息、构建产物等，在格式和内容上适合被 LLM/Agent 直接消费，而无需额外解析或猜测。其核心维度有三：结构化（机器可解析的格式）、语义化（错误信息包含原因，不只有现象）、上下文完整（包含历史数据、代码位置等额外维度）。</p>\n<p><strong>NDJSON</strong>（Newline-Delimited JSON）是日志结构化的推荐格式：每行是独立可解析的 JSON 对象，既支持流式读取，也支持批量分析，是 CI 日志对 agent 友好化的最小代价方案。</p>\n<p><strong>Diff 预处理</strong>（Diff Preprocessing）指在将代码变更传入 agent 前，通过过滤生成文件、按优先级分块、生成摘要等手段，将超长 diff 压缩到 agent 的有效上下文窗口内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-ai-友好-是工程问题\">为什么&quot;AI 友好&quot;是工程问题</h2><p>Agent 从流水线获取上下文的主要来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>测试失败的原因（为什么失败，不只是失败了）</li>\n<li>代码变更的语义摘要（diff 太长时需要预处理）</li>\n<li>构建日志中的关键信号（噪声过滤）</li>\n<li>相关历史数据（同一测试上次是何时开始不稳定的）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果流水线仅输出&quot;测试失败：5 个用例未通过&quot;，agent 能做的很有限。如果输出包含失败原因的结构化分类、关联的代码位置、历史稳定性指标，agent 的诊断质量会有量级差异。</p>\n<p>这不是 agent 的问题，是流水线设计问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构化日志-从自由文本到可解析信号\">结构化日志：从自由文本到可解析信号</h2><h3 id=\"传统日志-vs-结构化日志\">传统日志 vs 结构化日志</h3><p>传统 CI 日志：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[12:34:56] Running test suite...&#10;[12:35:02] FAILED: UserAuthTest.testLoginWithExpiredToken&#10;[12:35:02] AssertionError: expected 401 but got 200&#10;[12:35:08] 47 tests passed, 1 failed\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[12:34:56] Running test suite...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[12:35:02] FAILED: UserAuthTest.testLoginWithExpiredToken</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[12:35:02] AssertionError: expected 401 but got 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[12:35:08] 47 tests passed, 1 failed</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AI 友好的结构化日志（NDJSON）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&quot;ts&quot;:&quot;2026-07-04T12:35:02Z&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:&quot;error&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;test_failure&quot;,&quot;suite&quot;:&quot;UserAuthTest&quot;,&quot;case&quot;:&quot;testLoginWithExpiredToken&quot;,&quot;assertion&quot;:{&quot;expected&quot;:401,&quot;actual&quot;:200},&quot;file&quot;:&quot;src/auth/token_validator.go&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:89,&quot;flakiness_score&quot;:0.02,&quot;last_failure&quot;:&quot;2026-06-01&quot;}&#10;{&quot;ts&quot;:&quot;2026-07-04T12:35:08Z&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:&quot;summary&quot;,&quot;total&quot;:48,&quot;passed&quot;:47,&quot;failed&quot;:1,&quot;duration_ms&quot;:12340}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-04T12:35:02Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test_failure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"suite\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UserAuthTest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"case\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"testLoginWithExpiredToken\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"assertion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"expected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">401</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"actual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/auth/token_validator.go\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"line\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">89</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"flakiness_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"last_failure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-06-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-04T12:35:08Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"summary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"passed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">47</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"failed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duration_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12340</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结构化日志的设计原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>每条日志是独立可解析的 JSON</strong>（NDJSON 格式）</li>\n<li><strong>包含 <code>category</code> 字段</strong>：<code>test_failure</code>、<code>build_error</code>、<code>lint_warning</code>、<code>security_finding</code></li>\n<li><strong>包含文件和行号</strong>：让 agent 能直接定位代码位置</li>\n<li><strong>包含历史维度</strong>：<code>flakiness_score</code>、<code>last_failure</code> 帮助 agent 区分新问题和陈旧问题</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"错误消息的语义化改造\">错误消息的语义化改造</h3><p>错误消息应包含三个层次的信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>What</strong></td>\n<td>发生了什么</td>\n<td><code>NullPointerException in UserService.getById</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Where</strong></td>\n<td>在哪里发生</td>\n<td><code>UserService.java:142, called from OrderController.java:89</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Why</strong>（可选但重要）</td>\n<td>为什么发生的上下文</td>\n<td><code>userId was null, input from POST /api/orders request param</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 GitHub Actions 中使用 <code>::error::</code> 注解语法可以让错误直接关联到代码位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 将结构化错误转换为 GitHub Actions 注解&#10;echo &quot;::error file=${FILE},line=${LINE},col=${COL}::${MESSAGE}&quot;&#10;&#10;# 示例：测试失败注解&#10;echo &quot;::error file=src/auth/token_validator.go,line=89::Assertion failed: expected HTTP 401 but got 200. Token expiry check may be bypassed.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 将结构化错误转换为 GitHub Actions 注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"::error file=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">FILE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">},line=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LINE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">},col=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">COL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}::${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MESSAGE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 示例：测试失败注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"::error file=src/auth/token_validator.go,line=89::Assertion failed: expected HTTP 401 but got 200. Token expiry check may be bypassed.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"上下文注入-给-agent-喂足够的信号\">上下文注入：给 Agent 喂足够的信号</h2><h3 id=\"pr-上下文摘要\">PR 上下文摘要</h3><p>对于 PR 级别的 agent（代码审查、测试生成），在触发时注入结构化的 PR 上下文：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Build PR Context&#10;  id: context&#10;  run: |&#10;    # 生成对 agent 友好的 PR 上下文 JSON&#10;    cat &gt; pr_context.json &lt;&lt; EOF&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;pr_number&quot;: ${{ github.event.pull_request.number }},&#10;      &quot;title&quot;: &quot;${{ github.event.pull_request.title }}&quot;,&#10;      &quot;base_branch&quot;: &quot;${{ github.base_ref }}&quot;,&#10;      &quot;changed_files&quot;: $(git diff --name-only origin/${{ github.base_ref }}...HEAD | jq -R . | jq -s .),&#10;      &quot;additions&quot;: ${{ github.event.pull_request.additions }},&#10;      &quot;deletions&quot;: ${{ github.event.pull_request.deletions }},&#10;      &quot;linked_issues&quot;: ${{ toJSON(github.event.pull_request.body) }}&#10;    }&#10;    EOF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build PR Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    # 生成对 agent 友好的 PR 上下文 JSON</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    cat > pr_context.json &#x3C;&#x3C; EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"pr_number\": ${{ github.event.pull_request.number }},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"title\": \"${{ github.event.pull_request.title }}\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"base_branch\": \"${{ github.base_ref }}\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"changed_files\": $(git diff --name-only origin/${{ github.base_ref }}...HEAD | jq -R . | jq -s .),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"additions\": ${{ github.event.pull_request.additions }},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"deletions\": ${{ github.event.pull_request.deletions }},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"linked_issues\": ${{ toJSON(github.event.pull_request.body) }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    EOF</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"历史测试稳定性数据\">历史测试稳定性数据</h3><p>Flaky test 是 CI 噪声的主要来源之一。在调用 agent 分析失败时，附带历史稳定性数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Enrich Failure Context&#10;  run: |&#10;    # 查询过去 30 天的测试稳定性数据&#10;    node scripts/get-test-stability.mjs \\&#10;      --test-name &quot;$FAILED_TEST&quot; \\&#10;      --days 30 \\&#10;      --output failure_context.json&#10;&#10;    # failure_context.json 包含：&#10;    # { &quot;flakiness_rate&quot;: 0.15, &quot;last_stable&quot;: &quot;2026-06-20&quot;, &quot;failure_pattern&quot;: &quot;timeout&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Enrich Failure Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    # 查询过去 30 天的测试稳定性数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    node scripts/get-test-stability.mjs \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --test-name \"$FAILED_TEST\" \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --days 30 \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --output failure_context.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    # failure_context.json 包含：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    # { \"flakiness_rate\": 0.15, \"last_stable\": \"2026-06-20\", \"failure_pattern\": \"timeout\" }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"diff-预处理-压缩-agent-的上下文消耗\">Diff 预处理：压缩 Agent 的上下文消耗</h2><p>大型 PR（千行以上的 diff）会迅速超出 agent 的有效上下文窗口，导致质量下降和成本飙升。预处理策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    D[原始 Diff] --&gt; S{Diff 大小判断}&#10;    S --&gt;|&lt; 500 行| FULL[直接传入 agent]&#10;    S --&gt;|500-2000 行| CHUNK[按文件分块处理]&#10;    S --&gt;|&gt; 2000 行| FILTER[智能过滤 + 摘要]&#10;&#10;    FILTER --&gt; SKIP[跳过生成文件 / vendor / lock]&#10;    FILTER --&gt; FOCUS[聚焦核心业务逻辑文件]&#10;    FILTER --&gt; SUMMARY[生成变更摘要注入上下文]&#10;&#10;    CHUNK --&gt; PARALLEL[并行处理各块]&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; MERGE[合并结果]&#10;&#10;    FULL --&gt; RESULT[Agent 产出]&#10;    MERGE --&gt; RESULT&#10;    SUMMARY --&gt; RESULT\">flowchart TD\n    D[原始 Diff] --&gt; S{Diff 大小判断}\n    S --&gt;|&lt; 500 行| FULL[直接传入 agent]\n    S --&gt;|500-2000 行| CHUNK[按文件分块处理]\n    S --&gt;|&gt; 2000 行| FILTER[智能过滤 + 摘要]\n\n    FILTER --&gt; SKIP[跳过生成文件 / vendor / lock]\n    FILTER --&gt; FOCUS[聚焦核心业务逻辑文件]\n    FILTER --&gt; SUMMARY[生成变更摘要注入上下文]\n\n    CHUNK --&gt; PARALLEL[并行处理各块]\n    PARALLEL --&gt; MERGE[合并结果]\n\n    FULL --&gt; RESULT[Agent 产出]\n    MERGE --&gt; RESULT\n    SUMMARY --&gt; RESULT</pre><p>Diff 过滤的优先级规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 按优先级排序文件，高优先级先进入 agent 上下文&#10;const FILE_PRIORITY = {&#10;  // 最高优先级：核心业务逻辑&#10;  high: [/^src\\//, /^lib\\//],&#10;  // 中等优先级：配置和测试&#10;  medium: [/^config\\//, /^test\\//],&#10;  // 低优先级：文档、资产&#10;  low: [/^docs\\//, /^assets\\//],&#10;  // 跳过：生成文件、依赖&#10;  skip: [/^vendor\\//, /package-lock\\.json$/, /\\.generated\\./],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按优先级排序文件，高优先级先进入 agent 上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FILE_PRIORITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 最高优先级：核心业务逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  high: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">src</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">lib</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 中等优先级：配置和测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  medium: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">config</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">test</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 低优先级：文档、资产</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  low: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">docs</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">assets</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 跳过：生成文件、依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  skip: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">vendor</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">package-lock</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">generated</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"输出格式标准化\">输出格式标准化</h2><p>Agent 的产出需要被后续步骤（门控判断、通知、记录）消费。输出格式标准化是关键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;agent&quot;: &quot;code-review&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.2.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pr_number&quot;: 456,&#10;  &quot;executed_at&quot;: &quot;2026-07-04T12:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;findings&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;f001&quot;,&#10;      &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;critical&quot;,&#10;      &quot;category&quot;: &quot;security&quot;,&#10;      &quot;file&quot;: &quot;src/auth/login.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;line&quot;: 42,&#10;      &quot;message&quot;: &quot;SQL query constructed with string interpolation, potential injection risk&quot;,&#10;      &quot;suggestion&quot;: &quot;Use parameterized query: db.query(&#39;SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $1&#39;, [userId])&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;summary&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;total_findings&quot;: 3,&#10;    &quot;critical&quot;: 1,&#10;    &quot;warning&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;suggestion&quot;: 0&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;recommendation&quot;: &quot;fail&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"agent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"code-review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pr_number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"executed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-04T12:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"findings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"f001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"security\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/auth/login.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"line\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SQL query constructed with string interpolation, potential injection risk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"suggestion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Use parameterized query: db.query('SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $1', [userId])\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"summary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"total_findings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"warning\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"suggestion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"recommendation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fail\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>标准化输出的优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消费方</th>\n<th>使用字段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>门控步骤</td>\n<td><code>recommendation</code>、<code>summary.critical</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 评论生成</td>\n<td><code>findings[*].message</code>、<code>findings[*].suggestion</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可观测性平台</td>\n<td><code>executed_at</code>、<code>summary</code>、<code>agent</code>、<code>version</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史趋势分析</td>\n<td><code>pr_number</code>、<code>summary</code>、<code>executed_at</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流水线配置的-ai-友好性检查清单\">流水线配置的 AI 友好性检查清单</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 日志层&#10;        L1[使用 NDJSON 结构化日志]&#10;        L2[每条日志包含 category]&#10;        L3[错误消息包含文件和行号]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 上下文层&#10;        C1[PR 上下文预先构建]&#10;        C2[历史稳定性数据可访问]&#10;        C3[Diff 超阈值时自动预处理]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 输出层&#10;        O1[Agent 输出为标准 JSON schema]&#10;        O2[severity 字段映射到三态门控]&#10;        O3[输出持久化为 artifact]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 日志层\n        L1[使用 NDJSON 结构化日志]\n        L2[每条日志包含 category]\n        L3[错误消息包含文件和行号]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 上下文层\n        C1[PR 上下文预先构建]\n        C2[历史稳定性数据可访问]\n        C3[Diff 超阈值时自动预处理]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 输出层\n        O1[Agent 输出为标准 JSON schema]\n        O2[severity 字段映射到三态门控]\n        O3[输出持久化为 artifact]\n    end</pre><p>关于 agent 在流水线中的具体触发时机，参见 <a href=\"agent-in-pipeline-patterns\">Agent 嵌入流水线的触发模式</a>。关于如何将 agent 产出构成持续改进的反馈闭环，参见 <a href=\"feedback-loop-architecture\">反馈闭环架构</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>让流水线对 AI Agent 友好，核心是三层改造：日志结构化（NDJSON 格式、带 category 和文件位置）、错误信息语义化（包含 What/Where/Why 三层）、上下文完整注入（PR 摘要、历史稳定性数据、经过预处理的 diff）。标准化的 agent 输出 JSON schema 使得门控判断、PR 评论、可观测性追踪、历史分析成为可能。这些改造不是为了 agent 特地增加开销，而是让流水线输出同时服务于人类工程师和 AI Agent 两类消费者。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI 友好的流水线设计","id":"ai-友好的流水线设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么\"AI 友好\"是工程问题","id":"为什么-ai-友好-是工程问题"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化日志：从自由文本到可解析信号","id":"结构化日志-从自由文本到可解析信号"},{"level":3,"text":"传统日志 vs 结构化日志","id":"传统日志-vs-结构化日志"},{"level":3,"text":"错误消息的语义化改造","id":"错误消息的语义化改造"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文注入：给 Agent 喂足够的信号","id":"上下文注入-给-agent-喂足够的信号"},{"level":3,"text":"PR 上下文摘要","id":"pr-上下文摘要"},{"level":3,"text":"历史测试稳定性数据","id":"历史测试稳定性数据"},{"level":2,"text":"Diff 预处理：压缩 Agent 的上下文消耗","id":"diff-预处理-压缩-agent-的上下文消耗"},{"level":2,"text":"输出格式标准化","id":"输出格式标准化"},{"level":2,"text":"流水线配置的 AI 友好性检查清单","id":"流水线配置的-ai-友好性检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Agent 嵌入流水线的触发模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/foundations/agent-in-pipeline-patterns"},"next":{"title":"反馈闭环架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/foundations/feedback-loop-architecture"}}